{
  "comment": "AOSP sources of the guest libc (ADR-0009, ADR-0021) in 'sources', fetched by tools/fetch-sources.py into build/sources/; those of ART and its libraries, with D8 and the JDK that build them (ADR-0033 a), in 'art', fetched by tools/fetch-sources.py --set art, the JDK from its 'url' after a check against its 'sha256'. The framework's sources and the host tools that build it (ADR-0039 b, ADR-0045 decision 1: aidl, aapt2, libandroidfw, framework-res), and the API files of the managers' generator (ADR-0045 decision 3), in 'framework', fetched by tools/fetch-sources.py --set framework. Commits of the tag android-15.0.0_r1; digest: SHA-256 over the sorted lines '<path> NUL <sha256 of the file>' of the extracted files. Skia, hwui, minikin, HarfBuzz, FreeType, the image codecs, the fonts and the headers their host flavor includes (ADR-0043 a), in 'graphics', fetched by tools/fetch-sources.py --set graphics.",
